WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.414
Step three opens the manifest: the arc
step, read-only, with its three controls,

2
00:00:06.414 --> 00:00:11.325
C M eight, C M six and I A five, its
three K S Is, and each file's hash.

3
00:00:11.325 --> 00:00:14.525
Step four tries a snapshot
whose cloud isn't recorded.

4
00:00:14.525 --> 00:00:18.110
It copies the fixture, sets its
environment to not recorded,

5
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:19.500
and runs the check on it.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.956
The check throws: the Arc results came
from a cloud that isn't recorded,

7
00:00:23.956 --> 00:00:27.787
and a G C C Moderate tenant's
Arc resources are in Azure Cloud.

8
00:00:27.787 --> 00:00:29.701
Then Test-Path shows false.

9
00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:32.570
The check refused the
snapshot and wrote nothing.
